  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JARASIA WOMEN SOCIETY-ICMPS 2023 IN JERASH GOV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Local Women Production Kitchen is a social enterprise aimed at empowering women in the city of Jerash. Through this initiative, we aim to support the provison of opportunities for women to earn a living by using their culinary skills to prepare and sell local food products. The kitchen serves as a platform for women to showcase their culinary expertise, and is expected to take approximately six months to complete. During this time, equipment will be purchased and installed, training opportunities provided, and the Local Women Production Kitchen will be fully established.The project aims to benefit 20 local women (low-income families), The age is from 18-60 years old.</narrative>
  </description>
